# TreeTagger Ukrainian tagset
#
# Ukrainian TreeTagger Part-of-Speech Tags. The coarse part-of-speech is encoded in
# the head of each tag (the part before the first '.') and follows the Universal
# POS categories (ADJ, ADP, ADV, AUX, CCONJ/CONJ, DET, INTJ, NOUN, NUM, PART, PRON,
# PROPN, PUNCT, SCONJ, SYM, VERB, X); the remainder encodes morphological features.
# The '_' tag (unspecified) and SENT are mapped to POS_X and POS_PUNCT respectively.
#
# Source: extracted from the TreeTagger model using TT4J
__META_SOURCE_URL__=https\://www.cis.uni-muenchen.de/~schmid/tools/TreeTagger/
__META_TYPE_BASE__=de.tudarmstadt.ukp.dkpro.core.api.lexmorph.type.pos.

ADJ=POS_ADJ
ADP=POS_ADP
ADV=POS_ADV
AUX=POS_AUX
CCONJ=POS_CONJ
DET=POS_DET
INTJ=POS_INTJ
NOUN=POS_NOUN
NUM=POS_NUM
PART=POS_PART
PRON=POS_PRON
PROPN=POS_PROPN
PUNCT=POS_PUNCT
SCONJ=POS_SCONJ
SENT=POS_PUNCT
SYM=POS_SYM
VERB=POS_VERB
X=POS_X
_=POS_X

# Catch-all rule
*=POS
